  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31f306b679a475f46cfe06e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，真是太开心了！　大家的“呼声”，\\n毫无疑问成了我的助力。谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1fd602dc9d576f09d55dfc3d62e9427f710c412d424a7f739bcc2de04b0da4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d1d8d29ac12df8cd871d4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！　连你的心也打动了啊！\\n下次我也会带来感动的，一定要见证到最后哦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845bd025161fb921448792cbede6e0c6d8a535dad23111121484ab6ea8bdfe3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1622"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0485e45b8acd15b956e22f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！　支持我的人们！　还有\\n感受到命运的、所有大家！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92aeafce35129abe10b52f5a99030d06b82e4b661a8eb32436b6c2882afd091e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1623"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322e833bad816e05236d8c59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！　连你的心也打动了啊！\\n下次我也会带来感动的，一定要见证到最后哦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845bd025161fb921448792cbede6e0c6d8a535dad23111121484ab6ea8bdfe3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1624"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6072880e35d4349b15d352",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！　支持我的人们！　还有\\n感受到命运的、所有大家！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92aeafce35129abe10b52f5a99030d06b82e4b661a8eb32436b6c2882afd091e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1625"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c19e56c5fdf4154d0b33c32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比起奖励，我更想用冰袋好好冰敷一下身体。\\n不过，常在战场。不会让身体彻底凉下来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32de91545cd9bc1c0678febd018ee9d4ffd2da28039a0c12c24410903c6a16fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1626"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8ad7c618398563ae4f91e62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关于状态管理，与刚志交流的心得\\n起到了作用。哼，得请他喝杯茶才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cb0e4790dc4ff1130dbe6dec62c70728a297438c63fab7f6ab43d500925c38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1627"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0178f199ab4757cc40bea2b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是在彻底拿下胜局之后。若在交锋中就过早确信，\\n就算是猫也会被穷鼠反咬一口的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5539a6838dd34adaa7ff3c850f8a1306ea6c2c7c36b9836ded5af706682f9f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1628"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37b3f80eedcef03e6391bf2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "杜绝给自己的借口，正视自身的软弱。\\n而后，再亲手击碎这份软弱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6266fdcca09a11ba05e178b05d4eeafd299c7719cf2ee8dcbf62b9dec73f19bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1629"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1e160908b290698054b860",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是「泡沫乐园」♪只要有买年票的话，\\n就随时都能在度假村里狂欢啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56a7f5b47fbc4a16c2d51e198154d4beeef789c460cc2256fed74de97195915",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03385698312eee232c4d90f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无处可逃的战场。正因如此才要深深扎根，\\n凛然绽放……我是怀着这样的信念去面对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea277311e2d68210acb2ae8c66ca0f45bc05192a13174e26351c6162e605d96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1630"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17eba6c094a528828a949620",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是在彻底拿下胜局之后。若在交锋中就过早确信，\\n就算是猫也会被穷鼠反咬一口的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5539a6838dd34adaa7ff3c850f8a1306ea6c2c7c36b9836ded5af706682f9f8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:797dffde55d62226c8ddd33c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "杜绝给自己的借口，正视自身的软弱。\\n而后，再亲手击碎这份软弱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6266fdcca09a11ba05e178b05d4eeafd299c7719cf2ee8dcbf62b9dec73f19bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1632"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1662f938b856a2847271f864",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无处可逃的战场。正因如此才要深深扎根，\\n凛然绽放……我是怀着这样的信念去面对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea277311e2d68210acb2ae8c66ca0f45bc05192a13174e26351c6162e605d96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1633"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2521fd4334bf237222b45ba6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "眼泪就先寄存在我这儿吧，我的爱徒啊。\\n待到更加合适、恰当的时刻，我再还给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3561e5373e168e1b7fd6108c857dab8b86a14ae7c652769879bc33557709fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1634"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001f32e04742b688b380802a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心怀憧憬之人啊，来叩响吾之俱乐部的大门吧。\\n让我们一同立志，共成大业吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a1d473e0c75fa2a81e14f501d0d0c287bd8227c06044735c00577399e75f809",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1635"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1852056b05ce8664e3087222",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "眼泪就先寄存在我这儿吧，我的爱徒啊。\\n待到更加合适、恰当的时刻，我再还给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3561e5373e168e1b7fd6108c857dab8b86a14ae7c652769879bc33557709fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1636"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a3640421a9c418f0915351",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心怀憧憬之人啊，来叩响吾之俱乐部的大门吧。\\n让我们一同立志，共成大业吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a1d473e0c75fa2a81e14f501d0d0c287bd8227c06044735c00577399e75f809",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1637"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a05217b5fd5c70a67045a3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（玫瑰帝国将手轻抚胸前微笑）\\n非常感谢。深感荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9366875c87ff24a9d865f8b03b279196579870d6ff2c936f1b71d5914bce194d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1638"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f0fa8ab13be27da4454f49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的。毕竟是要展现在各位面前的仪容。\\n我负起责任，亲手打理妥当。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4276c913bdc090aecd5adb61620d29e9516a12eb800cba1460a4ecebac766112",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1639"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14141cd35b5bd2c5d5664d94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是玩一款叫「胡萝卜吉」的养成游戏喔♪\\n我已经被泡沫吉给迷得神魂颠倒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c4b25710998bdbc99b6471b52589af58615f73415670a57aebdbc88e93f3a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119f299513b60b7f7438f117",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是提高每一次训练的质量。\\n这也多亏了训练员的倾力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a38b0bc709743606ecd5695c0e70460985c20283c80bf9009fd030d9c6d301d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1640"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57aa43d0abd5de50314870ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "泡澡、拉伸自不必说……我也会和同期生\\n一起玩游戏消遣，让身心都得到休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2152e65781cb2c32b35a8f73d644487b478083796a82a91e1d94b25de1823f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e5f9123a5bf42f5e0d1c46c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在此立誓。定将蔷薇一族的荣光，\\n呈献到各位的面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddb3b3d238fcdecdb27a5bfa67ead17131fb9df8c241aa9c8ce75a09f042332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1642"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252bfab8703f507814d23f97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是提高每一次训练的质量。\\n这也多亏了训练员的倾力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a38b0bc709743606ecd5695c0e70460985c20283c80bf9009fd030d9c6d301d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1643"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdd55c88e9131e9948cbc7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "泡澡、拉伸自不必说……我也会和同期生\\n一起玩游戏消遣，让身心都得到休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2152e65781cb2c32b35a8f73d644487b478083796a82a91e1d94b25de1823f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1644"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50e244d607c6f4af1c53723",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在此立誓。定将蔷薇一族的荣光，\\n呈献到各位的面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddb3b3d238fcdecdb27a5bfa67ead17131fb9df8c241aa9c8ce75a09f042332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1645"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ff1d6f2f89a85fc62463922",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "――感到安心。最重要的是，能向各位\\n展现蔷薇一族的实力，我感到由衷的欣喜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c72534935ff609256620bd9a7795bb37256921a8ea341807c5e05b6611e60a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1646"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af248e688a0155c203809b52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下一次，我也会再次献上。\\n将胜利的玫瑰，献给各位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c7f1597c9ba5216ed7e301d2aaaf5f6f8cb8a88a34e1c4ce3cd5fd33e66223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1647"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615b5d45fa067973e18c136c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "――感到安心。最重要的是，能向各位\\n展现蔷薇一族的实力，我感到由衷的欣喜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c72534935ff609256620bd9a7795bb37256921a8ea341807c5e05b6611e60a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1648"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ea9f5ff1860167f203d7dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下一次，我也会再次献上。\\n将胜利的玫瑰，献给各位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c7f1597c9ba5216ed7e301d2aaaf5f6f8cb8a88a34e1c4ce3cd5fd33e66223",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1649"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0abb4412e3e61e6705dbaf83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道呢？如果你只一直注视着我的话，\\n或许就会知道啰……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bad7a161d845f883fef2bb8f2b5e2d753fb963a85b83c72cdf8ae971bf9a54d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:859da400d6c21e3c2eafb587",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不会有丝毫大意。一瞬间的判断失误便会直接\\n决定胜负……这和自然界中的竞争是一样的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee12f6165c6f09dd08c98042805f25cca3bddb5b8f16065d45e98ca84e4cf1a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1650"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:820e32a13324fde7e087fee6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "主要以肉类和鱼类为主呢。为了不给胃部造成负担，\\n我会细嚼慢咽……怀着感恩之心用餐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d7e3bbff9a76fdbb1366cefb3d8836d4b61d7baa5408a6958515cdf9dc29e87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b4c4d0c4fdec03629a82dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能站在这里绝非理所当然……。\\n我只是再次将这份感激之情铭记于心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "017c1b876e6fa2529ebf76737927a86f755884ceef84ce5acf353d608a4f8f4c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1652"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81af13a115f83e92445805a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们一起进了深山闭关。虽然是很严酷的特训，\\n但星空之下――一起唱歌的时光非常治愈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc3fd731c42d6087bac500212c87f46099310d2f8191cd1d4a7181d60fe91e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1653"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7bc084752b880863005135",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既是竞争对手，也是很好的朋友。\\n上周我们还一起去买衣服了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9169c72f6e3e214bfe7170b61ff21adc777e0e6d96f353011df2df0113582b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1654"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0479288673543e231d2f444b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能站在这里绝非理所当然……。\\n我只是再次将这份感激之情铭记于心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "017c1b876e6fa2529ebf76737927a86f755884ceef84ce5acf353d608a4f8f4c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1655"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a033b3a7f50b5042bacc3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我们一起进了深山闭关。虽然是很严酷的特训，\\n但星空之下――一起唱歌的时光非常治愈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc3fd731c42d6087bac500212c87f46099310d2f8191cd1d4a7181d60fe91e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1656"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8257c3f74ef25d9c88c558b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既是竞争对手，也是很好的朋友。\\n上周我们还一起去买衣服了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9169c72f6e3e214bfe7170b61ff21adc777e0e6d96f353011df2df0113582b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1657"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b259f80c29e51ee5e9cda27f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我打算和训练员一起去吃野味料理。\\n那可是一家很难订到位的店哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf74b8a3de2845eb2df9ad5c0fb04a94fd31bbf2e3b5a921db7f4aa3173293a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1658"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a0fe7e1b5703b5a888ad9c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。不过……我还会把\\n更加辉煌的纪录带回故乡的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a10865aa26a13b8ca46eeaa6658f1bc0bc55d3f1ce04d635316ec181c97e85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1659"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920139b3dc827a5a5b514d69",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来约定吧！我下次也会用自己的表现\\n来让大家见证「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "455c6a3d2a5019c4f49f36e0629d315fa3566ed79246855faff82e1c0e0fd1ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd4f906dc5b11b4d44881d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我打算和训练员一起去吃野味料理。\\n那可是一家很难订到位的店哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf74b8a3de2845eb2df9ad5c0fb04a94fd31bbf2e3b5a921db7f4aa3173293a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1660"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f6acdd5473f0c27111556d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。不过……我还会把\\n更加辉煌的纪录带回故乡的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a10865aa26a13b8ca46eeaa6658f1bc0bc55d3f1ce04d635316ec181c97e85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59bf8cab3c30ce5ec8cff099",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！能让你们像这样用闪闪发亮的眼睛\\n看着我，对我而言就是最大的鼓励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87072a879008054ca9c155f58113e67b2a1f86e3873d0b55161cb79c739e7fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bd3afff16da63c1536c3b3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「吃得饱饱的」……这好像跟平时没两样……\\n到下次比赛前，先让我想一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02203931f5e2e6e67a6e344e7c77348baebfad1ce877d9ad6ea3ee4e836ea029",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:253de447f1de5ed1dca4f66f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我自己是不太清楚……但我跑步时的表情\\n难道真的那么恐怖吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7c7a36321f6eea952ea33476bfcf78de8b797d42b90c3c4f5e2c38f82daee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c9083b5764f522ca85531d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是……非常值得尊敬，除了\\n独一无二的恩师之外没有其他词汇可以形容♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a612f3ed0d21c9dfdc382061df5c41137f0177f810af78bbd03a3a15eae1a6a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00965f68c5842780984caf0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的声援总是能给我许多帮助……\\n希望大家今后也能一直看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096107e5ed0a8e0f1b56cec923c866fbc21a992aa490f07a8b5d844474013732",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbb3fee02d3f221ba0f6580",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海鳗……不对，是虎鲸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "560a312c6b949572e17485b3662fc7d8e530f9b59c72ca141a35dc33efac4d8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e1fc2503a10b575263bdf47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我为了要在训练员脸上乱涂鸦，就把\\n墨水换成了墨汁啰。应该是因为这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c526cd60a3bdd0976a1ced052d297a62c310f00a87d08b4daadff3bcd514eac1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa33adfed9ce0f7ae18184d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙马上就塞了一堆训练过来。\\n应该要一边看着棋谱一边进行五组PK赛才对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83eec9633d3b6585425b7498d7e979c849664e52de41a3333c68e1d03f137f03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5856a3057d31c6b16c26d8f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然我很想说……竞赛对我而言全都一样，\\n但还是……唔唔～我要加油──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4bc7cdff39e28257b6791a0b148904b4cd492f7cf619379c22b1f8813845b7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:201b8b0c81e590f1b8534f3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我一直都很────拼命地去比赛，\\n所以根本就没时间去觉得辛苦呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35652432399ae4c4ade49447dfad56ebf4be22767aea04d9732169c75c320f86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54ff336a239a5dc5f9a1b7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是还没有啦……但感觉之后应该会郑重地\\n来跟我说一些……让人感到害臊的话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1519203fb951e49b04efeb376d220752aba247aebb26f5aae507e88d7210cab3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334ecac96f3b577d76cffb6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很荣幸能与那样的对手们较劲。\\n我会抱着虚心求教的态度下场比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fdf4ad8f83e84ac8bed2eaa029c79db7881a5b11daabc7cf152b796ab3e50a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32597251cc88b6308295f9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在小地方发生了明显的失误……\\n不过，我一定会在决赛之前改进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ae9670591b59a42f2e969f29d9dae7245b6a7aad3a432afd3395c568569343",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c3c3e96cc86195e4973824",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原本想尝试看看脚步轻盈的跑法，但最后\\n还是决定采用力道强劲的风格去比赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "250ff92e7fcc49a338b332010e2cb0db3a231d8fe7a6dfe4734547bfd2a1a230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e79035ee1a47fe57eddb10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想向粉丝、工作人员以及训练员……\\n想向所有人表达感谢之意♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e97a4af4760ab5e72e6811e09f91731a0e44635f1345e356f52fb00caa6d10cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f1257d5055aa175c15b6da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各位有享受到美式规格的竞赛了吗？\\n我在决赛时会拿出世界级的表现喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1fe40538a0402dee2066ff3551bfab79fb21afe2d9946164a8d5a084c07e7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38603f6e0cbeb85de232809a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Good harvest！\\n现在的我感觉能在各种竞赛中获胜喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "682d030ff3c6a9b649087dbda1f11be7aa28d75ccb4f55dcda9014f7767261ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e85bd789bd1c48f22ae9df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员正在模拟竞赛时的情况！\\n我要做的只有相信他而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfe9944fa34e74ff8dce30b407e007e4acedcf5b2399e516764bf0ba85a97e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f36ed531d04f827246eb7da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竭尽全力与强敌激烈竞争的兴奋感，\\n实在是无可取代呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e125515d1b618a7884a6a933843fec883c798db266d567614cd6ff1770040d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51228f722472bad4b3e25e9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是要先把手机桌布上的目标竞赛日期\\n换成决赛的日期吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8828d1a87ac6cb3ae99ec15b1e3c91e3e2644af6e87a51610b9d89982bbaeed1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79b6135ffb0292b0a8db07d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "俗话说「胜不骄，败不馁」。\\n我想继续精进自己，不会让自己松懈下来喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "001f21bb06e4817b3c07363478d1ac204c575de5b5ff45d418e5c505f6523e26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5686871e6d6fdac9d4237afb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正合我意！不这样的话比赛就不有趣了！\\n不论对手是谁我都要用单挑一较高下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bb9c52fbc28d64d75386daf019dfebd9cfae20aaab20fb0d33b2711ff857017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3b3939e1dde6f640622988",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是最常见的炸猪排吧。\\n好，来帮队伍里的所有人各做一份！",
      "source_fingerprint": "990f4ddd0e859226646a1f4eef62f8888bc21aa8823727a78af04d2b81601977",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12228626ad3fe894a73bf828",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会出赛的应该都是很猛的家伙吧……\\n一想到这里，我就期待到不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b835210cf897e1269855f5d5790c92f68060dc24220c2066f8bef96a13172b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d579467b968d05abcf6cc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是双脚的保养吧。为了不要让自己受伤，\\n我也从生野那里获得了很多建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7703191ad3f1ceddf22b60b2b9c60d4fbfc20ccddf91c2dce61e82949768d1e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aafb0cd0b89f536602c1edfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "重点是要有想象力。从起跑开始前，\\n就锁定终点然后……BANG！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a6dba87ebaa2a77ea24543e307b02c9c9eeefe43377e5536a95c3fb53db42e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be82636e8aae790a20460e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不能失去冷静，要保持自己的步调。\\n多亏这样我才能在竞赛中顺利发挥出了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5165a6dda06287c48cd2d4876cf196268466fc154d5c1d90566bff6eb60bafdf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f619530cf3162abc5623c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊。不过我没有丝毫要退却的打算。\\n因为我会在准备万全且状态绝佳之下去挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd961f6f6065f6b8e6a943e65fab077ae718410f2071894bba435908ebde634",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf8a705a2122b92baa8f8bfa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "No──！！唯独这件事，不管给我\\n多少墨西哥卷饼都还是No！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f27bda8c972be85a520dcb7155ad364b8a85169ed93b4b3fc04b16239b85c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f657e1ea10304327ab53982f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "神鹰我还没有拿出真本事！接下来还会\\n推出更加认真的表演给大家欣赏喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b002fa6484cd4c1fdc666cca12555fb8599b76080e8acef2aee1657f21907126",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f6c41d90312d0cb2466b44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～不过最热血的还是神鹰我的热情！\\n可要小心别被烫伤喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c73ce785b1bd59339fa14d3c39d58d2054da1e1e53f9a025fbcb51ada3de70a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9274222d7ffb069a2d96cf39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是由火腿、秋葵、乌龙面搭配在一起的\\n致胜料理「霸王」套餐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b408f537f13ac29d86ce4f4f24016c64ac1d9509a0f20ca068327e24f5b0dd01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3bb4d2812e0c8e5448c67df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是要留意弹性速度以免过于单调这点。\\n然后将普契尼放在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "116c02ba0aee2e916d6211bc1efa07ae19125bf58bba72c15ac319c57f1ec7cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68afc949e1902091c4b365fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来大家都畏惧着我的才华！原谅我……\\n因为连我自己都无法抑制那份才华呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da5ea9c319afa064068a03c0c748189adad8395479b094f628f19e72c1b9e23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5087e9db3d37c8725bdbe0f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猛禽吗……挺不错的比喻。不管是我，\\n还是其他人，都只是为了生存而寻求着猎物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6633d98f105fa444a74ec16818358e084a47bb8adaf9ad8e155b8d5c1cb54daf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "198"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
